    "description": {
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">You live amongst agamidan who inhabit the earth, and your body has adjusted to take after the qualities of soil and sand, retaining mud, sand and dirt that grounds you and acts as a natural barrier to disease. You gain electricity resistance equal to half your level. Whenever you need to make a saving throw against disease, you treat the outcome of the roll as one degree of success greater. Your Acclimator terrain includes caverns and underground locations.</span></p>",
